---
import learning from '../data/learning.json';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';import {lessons,audio} from '../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Understand Salah Lab"><section class="intro"><span class="eyebrow">Attend to the words</span><h1>{learning.heading}</h1><p>Explore fifteen meaning lessons, from the opening takbir to the closing greeting. Read the Arabic, reveal its meaning, and check a detail.</p></section><div class="workspace bottom-gap"><section class="panel panel-body"><span class="eyebrow">Listen locally</span><h2>Al-Fatiha, in full</h2><audio controls preload="none" src={audio.file} aria-label="Al-Fatiha recited by Adeel Shaikh" style="width:100%">Your browser does not support this audio. <a href={audio.file}>Download the recording</a>.</audio><p class="micro">Adeel Shaikh · CC BY-SA 4.0. Full-surah recording, about 50 seconds. <a href={audio.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Recording and attribution ↗</a></p></section><aside class="sidebar"><div class="notice"><h2>A meaning lab</h2><p>Selected narrated wordings, not a full legal prayer manual. Roman guides are approximate. Local audio is included for Al-Fatiha; the other lessons are text-based.</p><a href="/sources/">Sources and wordings ↗</a></div></aside></div><section class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body filters"><label class="field">Find a recitation<input id="filter" type="search" placeholder="Bowing, Al-Fatiha, praise…"/></label><label class="field">Part of prayer<select id="category"><option value="">All lessons</option>{[...new Set(lessons.map(l=>l.area))].map(a=><option>{a}</option>)}</select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="saved-only"/> Saved only</label><button class="button secondary" id="export">Copy saved lesson list</button><span id="count" class="micro" aria-live="polite"></span></div></section><div class="card-grid">{lessons.map(l=><article class="panel activity-card" data-item-id={l.id} data-category={l.area}><span class="eyebrow">{l.area} · {l.audio?'Audio available':'Text lesson'}</span><h2><a data-reading-link={l.id} href={`/lesson/${l.id}/`}>{l.title}</a></h2><p class="arabic" lang="ar" dir="rtl">{l.arabic.length>80?l.arabic.slice(0,80)+'…':l.arabic}</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={`/lesson/${l.id}/`}>Open lesson ↗</a><button class="button secondary" data-save={l.id} aria-pressed="false">Save reading</button></div></article>)}</div><div class="empty" id="empty" hidden><h2>No lessons match</h2><p>Try another word or choose All lessons.</p></div><script>import '../lib/library';</script></Shell>
